d\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Mushrooms are a type of Mushroom found in Uncertainty Cave found inside the Desert Canyons (<a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>). (Also near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>) They are found scattered on the floor of the cave. Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a>, they do not shoot projectiles.\n</p><p>There are 4 colors of mushrooms. Red, green, blue, and purple.\n</p><p>Their caps value at average of 1500$.\n</p><p>If mysterious mushroom’s projectile hits chopped mushroom its cap becomes black non-collidable part.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sanded Green Mushrooms looks similar to sanded <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a></li>\n<li>Mushrooms become <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_Mushrooms\" title=\"Corrupted Mushrooms\">Corrupted Mushrooms</a> when a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushroom</a> spore destroys their cap, these become square when sanded.</li>\n<li>Red mushrooms can be found in the lost woods</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"ba